## Disclaimer

- All performance numbers in this repository were measured on a **single
  device** (RTX 5090 Laptop 24GB + Ultra 9 275HX). Results will vary with
  different hardware, drivers, operating-system state, and background load.
- All configurations and scripts are provided **"as is"**, without warranty of
  any kind. Use at your own risk.
- Language-model output can be inaccurate. Do not use it for medical, legal,
  or financial decisions without human review.
- You are responsible for complying with the licenses of the model, engine and
  toolchain you use, as well as with the laws and regulations of your
  jurisdiction.
